      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13416574895381927
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "A perusal thereof shows that the petitioner has undergone actual custody of 06 months and 16 days and there is no other criminal case pending against him.",
